# Celestial Plateau — Level 28-40
# Auto-generated zone: High-altitude mesa where the stars feel close enough to touch
# Faction: Aethelgard Alliance
# Rooms: 22
#
# Usage (in Evennia shell):
#   from evennia import batch_process
#   batch_process("world.batch_zones.celestial_plateau")

# --- Room 1/22 ---
dig Celestial Plateau - Entrance
@desc You stand on a ancient ridge overlooking a cavernous valley below. You notice a dark bloodstain marking the path forward, and you hear strange whispers drifting up from the depths.
@tags/set room-zone:celestial_plateau
@open south=south to Celestial Plateau - Ledge
@open east=east to Celestial Plateau - Nook

# --- Room 2/22 ---
dig Celestial Plateau - Nook
@desc The trail clings to the mountainside, with a corrupted drop on one side and majestic cliffs on the other. ethereal radiance bathes the peaks ahead, and the wind carries skittering claws.
@tags/set room-zone:celestial_plateau
@open west=west to Celestial Plateau - Entrance
@open south=south to Celestial Plateau - Gallery
@open east=east to Celestial Plateau - Hollow

